# Fixture: local-transcript, with both local origins up (the byte-range server
# on 8765 for the mp3, the directory server on 8766 for the transcript). Saves
# the transcript and plays once, then lets persistence finish. Run before
# transcript_offline_verify against the same data directory.
settle 30
assert snap item-id == local-260925
act pane:notes
settle 10
assert snap transcript-cues == 0
# Logical-space click at the button's centre (960x640 artboard): the probe's
# own selector layout resolved role:button to a point the host did not route
# to this button (2026-09-26), so this receipt is pinned to one artboard.
pointer-click 520 221
settle 180
assert snap transcript-item == local-260925
assert snap transcript-cues >= 80
act seek:0
act play
settle 8
assert event transport PLAYING
act pause
settle 60
capture transcript-seeded
log transcript_offline_seed complete
